function entity(string $type): array { $map=['groups'=>['table'=>'groups','title'=>'Gruppen'],'roles'=>['table'=>'roles','title'=>'Rollen'],'tenants'=>['table'=>'tenants','title'=>'Tenants'],'systems'=>['table'=>'systems','title'=>'Systeme']];if(!isset($map[$type]))throw new InvalidArgumentException('Ungültiger Bereich.');return $map[$type]; }

